From 2589844791a6b12c7b491ee852f28707c19775ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vikram Dattu <vikram.dattu@espressif.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 20:48:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ESP-IDF platform adaptations and robustness improvements

- Dtls_mbedtls: Fix for mbedtls 3.x compatibility
- ConnectionListener: Custom thread for ESP platforms to save memory
- SocketConnection: Increase resilience to memory errors, mbedtls 3.x
- Sctp: Fix multi-line comment and compiler warnings
- LwsApiCalls: Dynamic allocations, ESP thread support, parser enhancements
- SrtpSession: Fix compiler warnings
- Include.h: ESP-IDF specific defines and new API declarations
---
